==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[sweetgum]], [[sweet-gum]]

===Etymology===
{{compound|sweet|gum|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# any of several [[Oriental]] and [[American]] [[tree]]s, of the [[genus]] ''[[Liquidambar]]'', having [[brilliant]] [[autumn]] [[coloration]]; their [[wood]] is used for [[furniture]], [[woodpulp]] and [[plywood]]
## ''[[Liquidambar styraciflua]]'', the [[sweet gum tree]].

